---
description: Example worker boundary guidance for parallel RouteX contributors.
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prefer small, scoped changes that respect teammate ownership.
- Do not redefine shared configuration shape without updating schemas, docs, and tests together.
- If implementation code is missing, document intent and leave clear integration points instead of guessing runtime details.
- Avoid reverting unrelated work when multiple workers are active in parallel.
